Aztarac MiSTer contains separately licensed components:

- New Aztarac integration and board implementation: GPL-3.0-or-later.
- Vector framebuffer and presentation by Videodr0me: GPL-3.0.
- fx68k by Jorge Cwik: GPL-3.0-or-later, see rtl/cpu/fx68k.
- Spectrum T80 by Daniel Wallner, Sorgelig and contributors: BSD-3-Clause,
  see licenses/BSD-3-Clause-T80.txt and rtl/cpu/t80 source headers.
- JT49 by Jose Tejada: GPL-3.0-or-later, see rtl/jt49.
- Copied MiSTer framework: component licenses in sys source headers.
- MAME behavioral reference by Mathis Rosenhauer: BSD-3-Clause.

The combined core is distributed under GPL version 3 with the component
notices retained. Full GPL texts and the MAME and T80 BSD notices are in licenses/.
